 "sentences": [
  "Seventeen years before the eruption, Pompeii got a warning.",
  "In 62 AD, or possibly 63, a strong earthquake shook the city.",
  "Temples, houses and public buildings were badly damaged.",
  "Seventeen years later, repairs were still going on across Pompeii.",
  "Small tremors were common in Campania, and people were used to them.",
  "Vesuvius hadn't erupted in Roman times, so few saw the danger coming.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
